esent", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2369.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "He said: Grasp it and fear not. We shall return it to its former state.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Allah buyurdu ki: \"Tut onu, korkma; biz onu yine eski durumuna çevireceğiz\"", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "فرمایا اسے اٹھالے اور ڈر نہیں، اب ہم اسے پھر پہلی طرح کردیں گے", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Allah berfirman: \"Peganglah ia dan jangan takut, Kami akan mengembalikannya kepada keadaannya semula,", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "خُذْهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَخَفْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَنُعِيدُهَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/10c11327d4d8d4639a37.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we will bring it back", "bs": "vratit ćemo je", "tr": "onu geri getireceğiz", "fr": "nous la ramènerons", "id": "kami akan mengembalikannya", "ur": "ہم اسے واپس لائیں گے", "bn": "আমরা তা ফিরিয়ে আনব", "fa": "آن را بازخواهیم گرداند"}}, {"text": "سِيرَتَهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأُولَىٰ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "يُعِيدُهُۥ", "count": 6, "first": "10:4", "audio": "audio/a33a5582aa57a67a6812.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"en": "he/it brings it back", "bs": "vraća ga", "tr": "onu geri getirir", "fr": "il le ramène", "id": "dia mengembalikannya", "ur": "وہ اسے واپس لاتا ہے", "bn": "সে তা ফিরিয়ে আনে", "fa": "آن را بازمی‌گرداند"}}, {"arabic": "أُعِيدُوا۟", "count": 2, "first": "22:22", "audio": "audio/a74fdf684c00e3